          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger market expectations of higher future policy rates lead firms to reprioritise short‑term profitability over long, compute‑intensive R&amp;D, delaying large training runs and hiring and thus slowing the pace of frontier model development." />
